      "name": "and: a known false settles it — complete, whatever the other side",
      "graph": "shortCircuit",
      "note": "false && x is false for every x, so the answer rests on nothing but the false: not on the unanswered hours, and not on the defaulted policy. Reporting it missing or placeholder would hold up an answer that is already settled.",
