      "name": "or: a defaulted true settles it even while the other side is unanswered — placeholder",
      "graph": "shortCircuit",
      "note": "The counterpart to the and case above, and deliberately not its mirror: a provisional true settles an or, a provisional false does not settle an and while another operand is unanswered. The result is flagged placeholder, so it claims no more than that it rests on the default.",
      "inputs": {
        "p": {}
      },
      "expect": {
        "defaultSettlesOr": {
          "state": "placeholder",
          "value": true
        }
      }
